name "Symbolic-Regression"

\end_inset


\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
A fitness function is required to compare candidates.
 A symbolic regression is a common offline implementation to calculate how
 well a formula can explain data.
 The regression error must become as small as possible, which is the sum
 of the distance between the outputs and predicted values of a data set.
 xx
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset ERT
status open

\begin_layout Plain Layout


\backslash
