\begin_layout Chapter
Familiar Genetic Programming
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
In the following, the implementation of the approach to enhance genetic
 programming with familiarity is presented.
 As a reference for familiarity, a heuristic developed by an expert to solve
 a problem (origin) is used.
 As a measure for the changes some factors are presented that have led to
 the use of the 
\begin_inset ERT
status open

\begin_layout Plain Layout


\backslash
emph{Tree Edit Distance} (TED)
\end_layout

\end_inset

, which calculates the number of differences of computational trees.
 The fitness of the candidates is calculated as a possible path via a regression
, whose data is generated by black box approaches.
\end_layout

